{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A #16</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">2006 AMC 10A #23</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Circles with centers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> have radius 3 and 8, respectively. A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Common_internal_tangent_line\" title=\"Common internal tangent line\"> common internal tangent</a> intersects the circles at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c884057c1218625814fc38808eb0f395aac6928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/8932f7dfafa96fd7b5e9bd90951c495dea0015fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(2.5mm); defaultpen(fontsize(10pt)+linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=3;  pair A=(0,0), Ep=(5,0), B=(5+40/3,0); pair M=midpoint(A--Ep); pair C=intersectionpoints(Circle(M,2.5),Circle(A,3))[1]; pair D=B+8*dir(180+degrees(C));  dot(A); dot(C); dot(B); dot(D); draw(C--D); draw(A--B); draw(Circle(A,3)); draw(Circle(B,8));  label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,Ep,SSE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NW); [/asy]\" width=\"348\" height=\"192\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba79b557a4601aea8514d711f96dd4e7f912795d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 13\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } \\frac{44}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } \\sqrt{221}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\sqrt{255}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } \\frac{55}{3}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"490\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_AMC12A-16a.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d2/2006_AMC12A-16a.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"559\" height=\"312\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/7729f047e546e4c66a50e90ac65906f2b393f766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADE \\sim \\triangle BCE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" /> because\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15f54b03349f15a3d9e86f2e0254ea6b9ca4d26c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle AED \\cong \\angle BEC \\text{ (vertical angles)}\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93bd0216641c4c4361693fc079beeea6b5f12fb7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle ADE \\cong \\angle BCE \\text{ (tangent perpendicularity)}\\]\" width=\"333\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff1ddf6aa610ac904a125091618f4d20600389e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />.  The sides are proportional, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/6/d06e407fa6e3130d018897529e0a552fc45fdcf8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{DE}{AD} = \\frac{CE}{BC} \\Rightarrow \\frac{4}{3} = \\frac{CE}{8}\\Rightarrow CE = \\frac{32}{3}\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>And hence:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac9aae781147d387767225fa9f7a8c8746b1fae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[CD = CE + DE = 4 + \\frac{32}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{44}{3}}\\]\" width=\"305\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Probl